# Fonts are binary. Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (the Windows default,
# and what this repo is checked out with) rewrites LF to CRLF *inside* the
# file on checkout and quietly destroys it.
#
# This is not hypothetical here: the four Figtree "TTFs" committed to this
# repo were GitHub 404 HTML pages saved with a .ttf extension, and autocrlf
# then expanded their newlines on every checkout. Figtree never rendered —
# every heading silently fell back to Noto Sans.
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
